DESCRIPTION:Early stage investing sits at the front edge of the private ca
 pital continuum-where conviction\, judgment\, and relationships matter as
  much as spreadsheets. This immersive weekend is built for the profession
 al who's been curious about angel investing and backing startups and is r
 eady to get started. Whether you're weighing making direct deals or explo
 ring a limited-partner (LP) role in a fund-or want to understand both sea
 ts before you commit-you'll leave knowing how to move from the sidelines 
 to the cap table.
