DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Durham Walk & Roll for a day of connection\, co
 mmunity support\, and fun!\n\nAt the Walk you'll be able to explore the F
 oundation's resources\, meet others in the GBS\, CIDP\, and MMN* Communit
 y\, and help us continue to make a difference in the lives of those affec
 ted by these conditions. We are raising awareness and research funds for:
 \n                                                                       
                              \n*Guillain-Barré Syndrome (GBS)\n*Chronic i
 nflammatory Demyelinating Polyneuropathy (CIDP) \n*Multifocal Motor Neuro
 pathy (MMN)\n\nFREE PARKING at 705 Broad Street. Register online at: bit.
 ly/4yC8mkW.  For Foundation info\, visit: www.gbs-cidp.org.
DURATION:PT3H
