DESCRIPTION:Join us for our second annual New Hope Creek Biodiversity Day 
 - a celebration of the unique flora and fauna that call New Hope Creek ho
 me! This event will feature interactive presentations led by experts from
  the North Carolina Wildlife Resources Commission (WRC) on the topics of 
 aquatic wildlife\, mammals\, and habitat connectivity. The WRC and the Du
 ke Forest regularly collaborate with the shared goal of "keeping common s
 pecies common\," and this day honors that work! Duke Forest staff will al
 so highlight recent restoration projects and their benefits for wildlife 
 and the health of New Hope Creek.
DURATION:PT3H
