DESCRIPTION:The Congregation at Duke Chapel invites you to join our Adult 
 Bible Study as we explore Wisdom Literature in the Old Testament (Job\, P
 salms\, Proverbs\, Ecclesiastes\, and Song of Songs). What do we do with 
 our Christian faith when surrounded by neighborhoods of chaos? Join us fo
 r a discussion on God and meaning as we explore these ancient texts and t
 heir relevance for our lives today.\n\nThis Adult Bible Study will be led
  by Congregation intern Jia Cummings. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20261021T154809Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T094500
